  "title": "TLS: Don't let the debug file and key log file point to the same file",
  "description": "Use files_identical and don't let the debug file and key log file\npoint to the same inode. If they do, set the debug file to NULL\nbefore we open it, so it doesn't overwrite the key log file, and\nwarn the user (in a way that works in both CLI and the GUI.)\n\nFix #17258",
